  "instructions": [
    "preheat the oven to 375 degrees fahrenheit.",
    "in a clay tajine, mix together the chopped almonds, crushed cookies, coconut milk, date syrup, ghee, grated ginger, ground cinnamon, ground ginger, orange zest, and salt until well combined.",
